<p>If no page reaches half the pieces in pass 3, pages holding any one piece are shown. Pages matching more pieces rank first, then by score. The score weighs a concept match most, then the title, tags, summary and body; a title that starts with the word earns 3 extra points and one that merely contains it earns 1. Remaining ties put evergreen pages ahead of dated news. That is why typing "harness" on the Korean screen puts the defining page, <a href="#!hns-overview">What a Harness Is</a>, first.</p>

